      "side": 1,
      "message": "There are 2 failure cases:\n\n1. If ec_command fails, we want to just print \u0027ERROR (rv\u003d%d)\u0027.\n2. If ec_command is good (rc \u003d\u003d 0) but fan_off \u003d\u003d fan_max, we want to print \u0027N/A (fan_off\u003dx and fan_max\u003dx).\n\nCase 2 is needed for boards which use custom control but don\u0027t have fan_off nor fan_max (or set them incorrectly).",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 3316,
