      "writtenOn": "2022-10-08T06:38:26Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "@Dai, Thankyou.\nadded condition to handle the following 5 cases,\n\n```\n#1. CMD_SUCCESS, (fan_off !\u003d fan_max) !\u003d 0\nlocalhost ~ # ectool temps all\n--sensor name -------- temperature -------- ratio (fan_off and fan_max) --\nDDR and SOC           310 K (\u003d 37 C)           8% (308K and 333K)\nFan                   301 K (\u003d 28 C)           0% (308K and 333K)\nCharger               310 K (\u003d 37 C)           8% (308K and 333K)\n\n#2. CMD_SUCCESS, (fan_off \u003d\u003d fan_max) \u003d\u003d 0\n#3. CMD_SUCCESS, (fan_off \u003d\u003d fan_max) !\u003d 0\nlocalhost ~ # ectool temps all\n--sensor name -------- temperature -------- ratio (fan_off and fan_max) --\nDDR and SOC           306 K (\u003d 33 C)         N/A (fan_off\u003dx, fan_max\u003dx)\nFan                   300 K (\u003d 27 C)         N/A (fan_off\u003dx, fan_max\u003dx)\nCharger               305 K (\u003d 32 C)         N/A (fan_off\u003dx, fan_max\u003dx)\n\n#4. CMD_SUCCESS, (fan_off\u003d\u003d0 fan_max !\u003d 0)\nlocalhost ~ # ectool temps all\n--sensor name -------- temperature -------- ratio (fan_off and fan_max) --\nDDR and SOC           306 K (\u003d 33 C)          91% (0K and 333K)\nFan                   300 K (\u003d 27 C)          90% (0K and 333K)\nCharger               305 K (\u003d 32 C)          91% (0K and 333K)\n\n#5. CMD_FAILED (rc \u003c 0)\nlocalhost ~ # ectool temps all\n--sensor name -------- temperature -------- ratio (fan_off and fan_max) --\nDDR and SOC           306 K (\u003d 33 C)               error(rc\u003d-1)\nFan                   300 K (\u003d 27 C)               error(rc\u003d-1)\nCharger               305 K (\u003d 32 C)               error(rc\u003d-1)\n```",
